<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Prompt used for the Reflection agent in <span id="A1.F6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span>.</figcaption>
</figure>
