<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Mean score and standard deviation for CTRS and PANAS across sessions for counseling dialogues from Psych8k (Psych), CACTUS (CAC), and <span id="A9.T9.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span> (MAG). Here Met. denotes Method. Asterisks (*) indicate significant differences from <span id="A9.T9.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span> (<math id="A9.T9.m100" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math>, paired t-test). For CTRS: U (Understanding), I (Interpersonal Effectiveness), C (Collaboration), G (Guided Discovery), F (Focus), S (Strategy). For PANAS: Pos. Att. (Positive Attitude), Neu. Att. (Neutral Attitude), Neg. Att. (Negative Attitude), P (average shift in positive emotions), N (average shift in negative emotions). <math id="A9.T9.m101" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\delta(\%)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo>%</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta(\%)</annotation></semantics></math> shows <span id="A9.T9.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span>’s %-age margin over the best baseline.</figcaption>
</figure>
