<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>Mean score and standard deviation for CTRS across sessions for models fine-tuned on data from Psych8k (Llama-Psych8k), CACTUS (Llama-CACTUS), and <span id="A9.T11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span> (Llama-<span id="A9.T11.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span>). <math id="A9.T11.m51" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\delta(\%)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo>%</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta(\%)</annotation></semantics></math> shows Llama-<span id="A9.T11.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span>’s %-age margin over the best baseline.</figcaption>
</figure>
