<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 14: </span>Mean score and standard deviation for CTRS and PANAS across sessions for counseling data from <span id="A9.T14.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span> ablations: M<sub id="A9.T14.9" class="ltx_sub">-C</sub> (no CBT agent), M<sub id="A9.T14.10" class="ltx_sub">-T</sub> (no technique agent) and M<sub id="A9.T14.11" class="ltx_sub">-C-T</sub> (no CBT and technique agent). Here Met. denotes Method. M denotes <span id="A9.T14.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span>. <math id="A9.T14.m123" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\delta(\%)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo>%</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta(\%)</annotation></semantics></math> shows <span id="A9.T14.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">MAGneT</span>’s %-age gain over the best ablation.</figcaption>
</figure>
